Tool response:
Tool: find_visit_by_visitor_location_and_date
Description: Locate a visit record for a specific visitor at a specific location on a given date.
Returns the visit ID, visitor ID, location ID, host ID, and status.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "visitor_name": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Full name of the visitor",
          "title": "Visitor Name"
        },
        "location_name": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Name of the location",
          "title": "Location Name"
        },
        "scheduled_date": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Scheduled date of the visit in YYYY-MM-DD format",
          "title": "Scheduled Date"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "visitor_name",
        "location_name",
        "scheduled_date"
      ]
    }

Tool response:
Tool: update_visit_checkout
Description: Record the departure time for a visit and update its status to checked out.
Requires the visit ID, checkout time, and ensures the visit exists and is not already checked out.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "visit_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "description": "ID of the visit to update",
          "title": "Visit Id"
        },
        "check_out_time": {
          "type": "string",
          "title": "Check Out Time",
          "description": "Checkout datetime in ISO format (e.g., 2025-04-15T18:45:00Z)"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "visit_id"
      ]
    }
